[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to a Path Traversal vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the API allows users to specify a filename for the song they wish to download without implementing adequate validation or sanitization of the input. If the filename is not properly checked, an attacker could manipulate the input to include directory traversal sequences (such as `../`) to access files outside the intended `/var/songs` directory. This could lead to unauthorized access to sensitive files on the server, compromising the security and integrity of the system.

